{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2023-06-26 09:00:00', 'title': 'ANSYS APPOINTS KATHLEEN WESLOCK AS VICE PRESIDENT OF HUMAN RESOURCES', 'text': "SEASONED HR PROFESSIONAL BRINGS DECADES OF EXPERIENCE TO GLOBAL LEADER AND INNOVATOR OF ENGINEERING SIMULATION SOFTWARE / KEY HIGHLIGHTS KATHLEEN WESLOCK NAMED AS VICE PRESIDENT OF HUMAN RESOURCES AT ANSYS WESLOCK BRINGS DECADES OF EXPERIENCE IN FOSTERING CORPORATE CULTURES AND ABILITY TO SCALE HR ORGANIZATIONS PITTSBURGH , JUNE 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ANSYS (NASDAQ: ANSS) HAS NAMED KATHLEEN WESLOCK, AN INDUSTRY VETERAN WITH DECADES OF EXPERIENCE IN HUMAN RESOURCES, LABOR RELATIONS, AND MERGERS AND ACQUISITIONS, AS ITS VICE PRESIDENT OF HUMAN RESOURCES. PRIOR TO JOINING ANSYS, WESLOCK SERVED AS THE CHIEF PEOPLE AND CULTURE OFFICER AT PEP BOYS DURING THE AMERICAN AUTOMOTIVE AFTERMARKET SERVICE CHAIN'S TRANSFORMATION TO INCREASE TECHNOLOGY ADOPTION IN ITS LEGACY BUSINESS."}